ghcr.io/thaynes43/blender-authoring - license notice
====================================================

This image bundles Blender @BLENDER_VERSION@, which is free software licensed under
the GNU General Public License, version 2 or later (GPL-2.0-or-later).

  Project:        Blender
  Version:        @BLENDER_VERSION@
  Copyright:      the Blender Foundation and contributors
  Source (exact): https://download.blender.org/source/blender-@BLENDER_VERSION@.tar.xz
  Source (git):   https://projects.blender.org/blender/blender/src/tag/v@BLENDER_VERSION@
  Binary used:    https://download.blender.org/release/Blender@BLENDER_SERIES@/blender-@BLENDER_VERSION@-linux-x64.tar.xz
                  (official build, checked against Blender's published SHA-256)

Blender is installed unmodified, from the official binary release, in /opt/blender.
Its license texts and copyright notices are in /opt/blender/license and
/opt/blender/copyright.txt, and copied to /usr/share/doc/blender-authoring/ in this
image (blender-license/ and blender-copyright.txt). Blender also bundles third
party libraries with their own licenses; those are listed in the same directory.

Other works in the image, each under its own license:

  Blender MCP   MIT. Source: https://github.com/ahujasid/blender-mcp at revision
                @BLENDER_MCP_REVISION@ (license: /opt/blender-authoring/blender-mcp/LICENSE).
  glTF Transform @GLTF_TRANSFORM_VERSION@ (MIT) and glTF Validator
                @GLTF_VALIDATOR_VERSION@ (Apache-2.0), installed from npm.
  Debian packages (including FFmpeg, which Debian builds under the GPL) and the
                Node.js base image keep their copyright files under
                /usr/share/doc/*/copyright. Source for the Debian packages is in the
                Debian archive (deb-src), for the release of the base image.

The image's own service scripts (service.py and others, in /opt/blender-authoring)
are built from https://github.com/thaynes43/haynes-ops/tree/main/scripts/blender-authoring .
